Package: visend
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 16) | curl
Maintainer: Vishota <vishota@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Vishota/visend
Description: Send files and text to yourself via Telegram from any terminal
 visend pipes stdin, arguments or files straight to your own Telegram chat:
 .
     ls | visend
     visend file report.pdf
 .
 Works through your own bot (direct Bot API) or a shared visend server.
 Ships two interchangeable implementations (nodejs and bash+curl); the
 /usr/bin/visend dispatcher picks node when available (>= 16), otherwise
 falls back to bash.
